 Ukrainian firefighters work at the site of a Russian missile strike of an apartment building in Kyiv yesterday. Photo: Genya Savilov/AFP via Getty Images 🇺🇦 Ukraine's Starlink and Starshield satellite services — critical tools in its war with Russia — have been restored to full capacity, a Ukrainian official tells Axios. The official also said that Ukraine conducted a strike overnight against a Russian oil refinery, defying President Trump's demand that it stop hitting those facilities. More from Barak Ravid . 💸 This week's government data paints a picture of a rip-roaring economy with all the inflationary pressures that might imply — putting the Fed in a difficult jam, Axios' Neil Irwin writes. Go deeper . 🤖 Apple and Meta, whose leaders have spent years trading barbs over privacy and the future of computing, are joining forces to bring one of America's most powerful open-weight AI models to Apple's high-end Macs. More from Ina Fried . 🐶 Luna, a Jack Russell terrier that's been on the loose around Yellowstone National Park for over a month, was caught and reunited with her owners this week. Go deeper . 
 
